Heating 50 -> 300 K over 100 ps, Bussi thermostat (ntt=11), backbone + active site restrained
 &cntrl
  imin=0, irest=1, ntx=5,
  nstlim=50000, dt=0.002,
  ntc=2, ntf=2,
  ntb=1,
  ntt=11, tautp=2.0,
  tempi=50.0, temp0=300.0,
  cut=9.0,
  ntr=1,
  restraintmask='(@CA,C,N,O&!:WAT,Na+,Cl-)|(:NI,KCX&!@H=)',
  restraint_wt=10.0,
  ntpr=500, ntwx=500, ntwr=5000,
  ioutfm=1, ntxo=2,
  ig=-1,
  nmropt=1,
 /
&wt type='TEMP0', istep1=0, istep2=40000, value1=50.0, value2=300.0 /
&wt type='TEMP0', istep1=40001, istep2=50000, value1=300.0, value2=300.0 /
&wt type='END' /
